      "text_raw": "The IIP3 and Noise Figure\nare shown.\nFor the IIP3 the gain is\nmeasured and the 3rd-order\nintermodulation distortion.\nThe extrapolated curves\nmeet at an input signal level\nof about −4.7 dBm. This is\na normal value for a MOST\ninput, which has a V −V\nGS T\nof only 0.22 V.\nThe Noise Figure is not\nthat flat but is never much\nhigher than 3 dB up to\n900 MHz.\nIn this LNA, the ESD\nprotection is not part of the design procedure. A better approach is given next.",
      "text": "The IIP3 and Noise Figure are shown. For the IIP3 the gain is measured and the 3rd-order intermodulation distortion. The extrapolated curves meet at an input signal level of about −4.7 dBm. This is a normal value for a MOST input, which has a V −V GS T of only 0.22 V. The Noise Figure is not that flat but is never much higher than 3 dB up to 900 MHz. In this LNA, the ESD protection is not part of the design procedure. A better approach is given next."
